								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 119<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=792"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12084#msg12084"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12084#msg12084">Re: Stupid People</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #32 on:</b> October 27, 2004, 12:18:41 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Just because that is the reason I thought Flamevault went down doesnt make me a retard. You should watch your language because it will come back to haunt you. I would never use that name or any other insulting name because number one what if you did have a kid that was retarded, you would think twice using that name!! Somehow I think you would continue with your incrediblly mean insults but I dont care. I just have had enough of your stupid shit!!&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
