							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							TFA&#039;s attempts at being the internet tough guy, and trying to inflate his virtual wang are somewhat amusing. If only to fill in space.<br /><br />He reminds me of these guys that they recently hired here at work, you know, the type that come from those special schools, kinda slobber a bit, but over all, they have about the mental capacity of a trained chimp. The ok for putting the round peg, into the square hole kind of intelligence.<br /><br />Keep trying, one day, you&#039;ll find the right one, and it will fit. Then your trainer will give you some kibble.
						</td>
					</tr>
