							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12110#msg12110"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12110#msg12110">Re: Stupid People</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #41 on:</b> October 27, 2004, 10:56:35 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Kin, you should just reply with &quot;window licker abortion&quot; to every thread, because you&#039;re already becoming incredibly redundant.&nbsp; I tried to help you out earlier with a crash course in how to flame, but I guess you are just completely inept.&nbsp; Maybe you&#039;re illiterate and talk and speak is your only savior, who knows.&nbsp; I know quite a few people here think you&#039;re hillarious, which is funny because I went to see that Team America movie and there were these jackasses laughing at the opening credit sequence behind me...I draw a parallel line to those guys and half of the people on this board.&nbsp; Fact is, you&#039;re not funny.&nbsp; You&#039;re quite the opposite.&nbsp; I don&#039;t want to be mean to you, but I have to be blunt just to let you know.&nbsp; It&#039;s like watching Garfield sling insults.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
