								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12111#msg12111">Re: Stupid People</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #42 on:</b> October 27, 2004, 12:46:17 pm &#187;</span></td>
