							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Aww.. I feel the love, the idiot retard boy is trying to teach me something... shucks, and I thought he was just here to spew his bullshit for all to hear.<br /><br />I feel very honored to hear that you are giving instructions on how to flame, really, honest, I really mean that... <br /><br />BWHAHAHA<br /><br />What an ignorant bastard you are. <br /><br />You&#039;re mildly entertaining so far, I&#039;ll give ya that. But nothing else.
						</td>
