	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12114"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=908" title="View the profile of Xia">Xia</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 4<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=908"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:rocket@tampabay.rr.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12114#msg12114"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1150.msg12114#msg12114">Re: Stupid People</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #43 on:</b> October 27, 2004, 02:20:44 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I just wanted to let you guys know that I have informed the moderator of this discussion and am anxiously waiting for a reply.&nbsp; When I created my account I had to agree to a terms of service statement- as did all of you.&nbsp; That statement specifically says that, and I quote:<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"><b>You agree, through your use of this forum, that you will not post any material which is false, defamatory, inaccurate, sexually oriented, invasive of a person&#039;s privacy, or otherwise in violation of any International or United States Federal law. </b>You also agree not to post any copyrighted material unless you own the copyright or you have written consent from the owner of the copyrighted material. Spam, flooding, advertisements, chain letters, pyramid schemes, and solicitations are also forbidden on this forum.<br /></div><br />The posts in this thread, and others that I have read, have been very rude and defamatory towards other members of the board, and it should not be tolerated.&nbsp; This forum is for the purpose of venting our frustations at the world, not doing this so-called &quot;flaming&quot; of each other.&nbsp; All of you should be ashamed, and I hope someone in charge takes appropriate action<br /><br />PS- I apologize if I have offended anyone with this post, but I attempted not to point out any names so my plea could remain impersonal.&nbsp; This is not directed at anyone in particular, I just felt that my feelings on the issue should be known.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
